"pg-diagnostic-checklist":{"description":{"zh":"排查 PostgreSQL 慢查询、死行膨胀与写入抖动的三步查表法：EXPLAIN ANALYZE BUFFERS、xmin 卡点与分页/WAL 检查点。","en":"Three diagnostic checks for slow or bloated PostgreSQL queries: EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS), pinned xmin/dead tuples, and splits/FPW spikes."},"source":"../computing/software/how-postgresql-runs-a-query/#ch11","lessons":[{"slug":"how-postgresql-runs-a-query","step":null,"anchor":"ch11","category":"computing","stage":"university","primary":true}],"aliases":{"zh":["PostgreSQL 慢查询排查","EXPLAIN ANALYZE BUFFERS 怎么看","PostgreSQL 性能调优清单"],"en":["postgres slow query checklist","explain analyze buffers guide","postgresql query troubleshooting"]}},
