"rdma-nic":{"description":{"zh":"程序把工作请求放进和网卡共用的队列，网卡把数据写进另一台机器登记过的内存，对方 CPU 不参与。","en":"A program posts a work request to a queue shared with the NIC, and the NIC writes into registered memory on another machine without its CPU."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-a-nic-moves-packets/#ch11","lessons":[{"slug":"how-a-nic-moves-packets","step":null,"anchor":"ch11","category":"computing","stage":"university","primary":true}],"aliases":{"zh":["队列对","单边写","RDMA verbs","SmartNIC","DPU"],"en":["queue pair","one-sided write"]}},
