"gpu-code-checklist":{"description":{"zh":"拆得开吗、走得齐吗、读得近吗：把前面各章收成一张清单，再指向讲内存、缓存和互连的各篇。","en":"Can it be split, do the threads move together, are the reads close: the chapters condensed into a checklist, with pointers to the essays on memory, caches and interconnects."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-a-gpu-computes/#ch12","lessons":[{"slug":"how-a-gpu-computes","step":null,"anchor":"ch12","category":"computing","stage":"university","primary":true}],"aliases":{"zh":["怎么写快的 CUDA 代码","CUDA 优化清单","GPU 代码为什么慢"],"en":["CUDA performance tips","how to write fast CUDA","why is my GPU code slow"]}},
