"quantization":{"description":{"zh":"把页面上的小模型量化到 8、4、3、2 位当场重测：8 位和 4 位几乎无损，2 位时归纳头被压坏；4 位权重让单人解码快近 4 倍。","en":"The page's tiny model quantised to 8, 4, 3 and 2 bits and re-measured: 8 and 4 bits barely change it, 2 bits breaks the induction head; 4-bit weights make single-user decoding nearly 4× faster."},"source":"../computing/ml/what-a-frontier-model-takes/#ch9","lessons":[{"slug":"what-a-frontier-model-takes","step":null,"anchor":"ch9","category":"computing","stage":"university","primary":true}],"aliases":{"zh":["量化是什么","4bit量化","INT8","模型压缩","GPTQ","为什么量化会变笨"],"en":["what is quantization","4-bit quantization","INT8","model compression","GPTQ","does quantization hurt quality"]}},
