"reading-a-memory-module":{"description":{"zh":"CL 折成纳秒是多少；程序等的是延迟还是带宽；插几根、跑在什么速度上。","en":"What CL is in nanoseconds; whether the program waits on latency or bandwidth; how many modules per channel and at what speed."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-memory-talks/#ch12","lessons":[{"slug":"how-memory-talks","step":null,"anchor":"ch12","category":"computing","stage":"university","primary":true}],"aliases":{"zh":["怎么看内存条参数","内存条上的数字什么意思","DDR5-6400 CL32 快吗"],"en":["how to read memory module specs","what the numbers on a RAM stick mean","is DDR5-6400 CL32 fast"]}},
